OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FChance of a shower across
OL,6,Fnorthern Aberdeenshire at first this
OL,7,Fmorning. Otherwise it will be a dry
OL,8,Fday with variable amounts of cloud and
OL,9,Fsunny intervals.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fsome late brightness. Then the rest of
OL,13,Fthe night will be dry with clear
OL,14,Fperiods. Becoming chilly in some
OL,15,Fsheltered glens.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FStarting off dry. Thickening
OL,18,Fcloud will bring outbreaks of rain
OL,19,Ffrom the west in the afternoon along
OL,20,Fwith freshening southerly winds. Drier
OL,21,Fin the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
